## Views.cpp/put_back, a file too large to keep
changed a, made made, removed gone, large shrank: differences [a, gone, made]
kept: files [a, gone, n/b, view.vlp]; folders [n/]; left [large]
put back: [.vulpen/, .vulpen/c=rewritten, a=1, gone=4, large=small now, n/, n/b=2, view.vlp=version = 1]

## Views.cpp/put_back, a link out of the project
kept: files [a, view.vlp]; folders []; left []
outside: x changed, made made: differences []
put back, the folder the link leads to: [made=made outside, x=changed outside]

